ross all identified communities is Python.","Largest community is 'tests-input' (size 15, cohesion 0.11).","Highest cohesion community is 'xnch-dir' (size 8, cohesion 0.7).","Identified one architectural warning in the graph structure."],"files":[],"id":"obs_mqv7fdjn_d3a6fc7bdc8d","importance":5,"narrative":"Retrieved a high-level architectural graph overview of the system. The analysis reveals a Python-centric modular structure organized into 49 distinct functional communities ranging from testing and auth to pipeline and memory management.","sessionId":"283b9ba1-0eba-4a0c-ba9d-0cf00eb4bc4b","subtitle":"High-level structural analysis of codebase communities","timestamp":"2026-06-26T17:27:56.968Z","title":"Architecture Overview Analysis","type":"discovery"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mqv7fduy_d1e7927c2537":{"observation":{"concepts":["Kubernetes deployment","Docker configuration","Infrastructure as Code","Multi-cluster architecture"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Dockerfiles found for nexi and xnch in /deploy/docker/","Kubernetes manifests organized into i7-node and i9-node clusters","Includes deployments for: langfuse, litellm, perception-daemonset, postgres-pgvector, redis, xnch, mem0, nexi, vllm-gemma4, and zep","Includes K8s jobs for consolidation and vault-indexer","Configuration files present for mem0, openclaw, and zep"],"files":["/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/docker/nexi.Dockerfile","/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/docker/xnch.Dockerfile","/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/i7-node/langfuse.yaml","/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/i7-node/litellm-deployment.yaml","/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/i7-node/perception-daemonset.yaml","/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/i7-node/postgres-pgvector.yaml","/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/i7-node/redis.yaml","/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/i7-node/xnch-deployment.yaml","/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/i9-node/mem0-deployment.yaml","/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/i9-node/nexi-deployment.yaml","/Users/xnch/x